  <biography>k__BackingField: 'A renowned dragon trainer of the royal stables. He
    raised beasts from

    hatchlings, training them with brutal force and shaping
    them into weapons for war. Despite

    his reputation, he formed a unique bond
    with one dragon. When the king ordered the

    creature to be sent to the front
    lines, Kaelen set it free. For this act of treason against the

    crown, he
    was publicly executed, never revealing where the dragon had gone.'
